OL,3,GNEWSATeenage artist finds confidence in
OL,4,Aillustrating
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old girl who previously
OL,7,Fexperienced situational mutism is now a
OL,8,Fpublished book illustrator after
OL,9,Ffinding the confidence to share her
OL,10,Fartwork through storytelling.
OL,12,FBethany, a student in Cambridgeshire,
OL,13,Fillustrated The Bestest Story in the
OL,14,FWorld... Ever! written by Chip
OL,15,FColquhoun and published last month.
OL,17,FColquhoun asked Bethany to illustrate
OL,18,Fhis book after she drew a portrait of
OL,19,Fhim while she was in the audience
OL,20,Flistening to him deliver a storytelling
OL,21,Fsession at her school.
